<view class="page"><view class="hero-head"><view><view class="page-title">薪算</view><view class="page-subtitle">算清到手工资，做出更好的职业选择</view></view><view class="brand-mark">薪</view></view><view class="salary-card"><view class="eyebrow">每月税前收入（元）</view><view class="gross-line"><text class="yuan">¥</text><input class="gross-input" type="digit" value="{{gross}}" bindinput="onGrossInput" placeholder="请输入税前工资"/></view><view class="salary-meta"><view class="meta-item"><text class="meta-label">工作城市</text><view class="selector-control" bindtap="openCityPicker"><view class="selector-value">{{city}}</view><view class="selector-arrow">⌄</view></view></view><view class="meta-item"><text class="meta-label">公积金比例</text><view class="selector-control" bindtap="openHousingPicker"><view class="selector-value">{{housingRate}}<text class="selector-unit">%</text></view><view class="selector-arrow">⌄</view></view></view></view></view><view class="section"><view class="section-head"><view class="section-title">缴纳参数</view><view class="link" bindtap="toggleAdvanced">{{advancedOpen?'收起设置 −':'高级设置 +'}}</view></view><view class="card"><view class="field-label">社保缴纳基数（元/月）</view><input class="field-input" type="digit" value="{{socialBase}}" bindinput="onBaseInput"/><view wx:if="{{advancedOpen}}" class="advanced"><view class="field-row"><view class="field-col"><view class="field-label">养老个人比例 %</view><input class="field-input" type="digit" value="{{pensionRate}}" bindinput="onPensionInput"/></view><view class="field-col"><view class="field-label">医疗个人比例 %</view><input class="field-input" type="digit" value="{{medicalRate}}" bindinput="onMedicalInput"/></view></view><view class="field-row extra-row"><view class="field-col"><view class="field-label">失业个人比例 %</view><input class="field-input" type="digit" value="{{unemploymentRate}}" bindinput="onUnemploymentInput"/></view><view class="field-col"><view class="field-label">专项附加扣除（元/月）</view><input class="field-input" type="digit" value="{{deduction}}" bindinput="onDeductionInput"/></view></view></view><view class="hint">城市默认值为演示参数，正式使用前请核对当地政策。</view></view><button class="primary-btn salary-cta" bindtap="calculate"><view class="cta-copy"><text class="cta-kicker">TAKE-HOME ESTIMATE</text><text class="cta-title">计算到手工资</text></view><view class="cta-arrow">↗</view></button></view><view class="section"><view class="section-head tools-section-head"><view><view class="section-title">常用工具</view><view class="tools-caption">为职场选择，多算一步</view></view><view class="all-tools-link" bindtap="goTools"><text>全部工具</text><view class="all-tools-arrow">↗</view></view></view><view class="tool-grid"><view class="tool-card" bindtap="goOffer"><view class="tool-icon mint">↔</view><view class="tool-name">Offer 对比</view><view class="tool-desc">比较全年真实收入</view></view><view class="tool-card" bindtap="goBonus"><view class="tool-icon peach">％</view><view class="tool-name">年终奖计算</view><view class="tool-desc">估算奖金税后收入</view></view></view></view><view class="footer-note">计算结果仅供个人规划参考，不构成税务或法律意见。</view><view wx:if="{{pickerVisible}}" class="selector-mask" bindtap="closePicker"><view class="selector-sheet" catchtap="stopPropagation"><view class="sheet-handle"></view><view class="sheet-heading"><view><view class="sheet-title">{{pickerTitle}}</view><view class="sheet-subtitle">选择后将用于本次收入估算</view></view><view class="sheet-close" bindtap="closePicker">×</view></view><view class="option-list"><view wx:for="{{pickerOptions}}" wx:key="index" class="option-item {{(pickerType==='city' && index===cityIndex) || (pickerType==='housing' && index===housingIndex)?'option-selected':''}}" data-index="{{index}}" bindtap="chooseSelector"><view class="option-label">{{item}}{{pickerType==='housing'?'%':''}}</view><view wx:if="{{(pickerType==='city' && index===cityIndex) || (pickerType==='housing' && index===housingIndex)}}" class="option-check">✓</view></view></view><view class="sheet-footnote">具体缴纳比例与城市政策请以当地最新规定为准。</view></view></view></view>